# Accepted misconfigurations for the dev / exploration scope.
# doc 04: "exhaustive hardening — minimum for demo/validation". Re-evaluate before prod.

# AZU-0041: AKS API server is not restricted to specific IP ranges.
# Restricting by IP (or a private cluster) would block CI/kubectl access from the
# dynamic IPs of GitHub-hosted runners. Accepted for dev.
AZU-0041

# AZU-0012: state Storage Account has no network rules (default action allows access).
# Setting default_action=Deny would block the CI runners from reading/writing the
# Terraform state. Accepted for dev; harden with private endpoint / IP allowlist for prod.
AZU-0012
